  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759021,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10 Pin: Champions Alley - PlayStation 2\n\nStep onto the lanes and strike out for fun with *10 Pin: Champions Alley*, an accessible and engaging bowling game perfect for players of all ages. Developed by Atomic Planet Entertainment Limited and published by Liquid Games, this PlayStation 2 classic delivers a vibrant and competitive bowling experience.\n\nGather up to seven friends for lively multiplayer battles, or hone your skills in solo practice mode. Choose from a diverse cast of exuberant characters, each possessing unique strengths and weaknesses, and compete across a variety of game types, from quick practice rounds to full-blown tournaments. Face off against colourful opponents and master the art of the strike.\n\nOriginally released in 2005, *10 Pin: Champions Alley* later became available as a PlayStation 2 Classic title on the PlayStation 3 via digital download, published by OG International. Combining simple controls with exciting multiplayer action, it's the ideal party game for kids and adults alike, promising hours of bowling entertainment."
    },
